{
  "about": [
    "Skill points paid by quests: each listed quest, once a player has completed it in Heracles, adds its points to",
    "one Pufferfish skill tree. Read by kubejs/server_scripts/skills/quest_skill_points.js, which keeps every online",
    "player's points from the source icraft:quests equal to the sum over the quests they completed (so an edit here",
    "reaches players who completed a quest before it, and a quest taken out takes its points back).",
    "The design (wiki design/master.md, Quest book chapter structure) budgets about 80 to 95 points over the whole book;",
    "this table pays 86: three onboarding quests 1 each (the design's Welcome chapter, 3), then each lane's tier",
    "milestone pays the lane's tree, and the tier ascensions pay Fortitude. Added 2026-10-18 (the fact-pass fixes, on recommendation, for review).",
    "Trees: warfare, marksman, sorcery, fortitude, gathering, engineering (the puffish_skills categories).",
    "Strict JSON, no comments; a quest id is its file name under config/heracles/quests without .json."
  ],
